2914 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Parameter 10\072 Conversion Architecture\n\nThe question being answered\072 \042Is the path from interest to action clear\054 frictionless\054 and appropriately matched to where the buyer is\077\042\n\nThis is the only parameter that touches execution over messaging but it\047s critical from a PMM lens\056 CTA language\054 placement\054 and friction are messaging decisions\054 not just design decisions\056\n\nWhat to look for\072\n\nIs there a single\054 clear primary CTA or multiple competing actions that create paralysis\077\nDoes the CTA language reflect the buyer\047s journey stage\077 \050\042See how it works\042 or \042Book a 20\055min walkthrough\042 is better than \042Get Started\042 for a cold visitor\051\nIs there a secondary CTA for the not\055yet\055ready visitor \050e\056g\056\054 read a case study\054 watch a demo\051\077\nAre there friction\055reducers near the primary CTA\077 \050No credit card required\054 14\055day trial\054 cancel anytime\051\nIs the primary CTA accessible across the full page and not just above the fold\077\n\nScoring guide\072\n\n5\072 Single primary CTA with buyer\055stage appropriate language\054 friction reducers present\054 secondary CTA for earlier\055stage visitors\n4\072 Good CTA language but missing friction reducers or secondary path\n3\072 CTA present but generic \050\042Get Started\042\054 \042Sign Up\042\051\056 These CTAs match no specific stage\n2\072 Multiple CTAs creating confusion in the visitor\031s mind\056\n1\072 No clear CTA or CTA leads to a high\055friction form with no value exchange\n\nFailure pattern\072 \n\n\042Book a Demo\042 as the only CTA on the page\054 with no secondary option for visitors who aren\047t ready to talk to sales yet\056 You\047ve built a page that only converts the 5\045 who are ready to buy and loses the 95\045 who aren\047t\056 Your page should engage the 95\045 also\056\n\nFill your Score \072)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 2915 0 R
     /Pg 2648 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

